<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK RESERVES IN JULY UP TO 8.9 BLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK RESERVES IN JULY UP TO 8.9 BLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said on Thursday</p>
<p>that its gold and foreign reserves rose to 8.88 billion kroons</p>
<p>in July from 8.64 billion kroons the previous month.</p>
<p> CENTRAL BANK RESERVES			     July '97 June '97</p>
<p> Gold (mln kroons)				   37.7     37.7</p>
<p> Convertible foreign currency (bln kroons)   8.85     8.62</p>
<p> Special drawing rights (SDR, mln kroons)    11.4     0.8</p>
<p> Other claims to the IMF (mln kroons)	  11.6     11.2</p>
<p> Notes and coins in circulation (bln kroons) 5.33     5.37</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
